<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 1.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 1.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     July 1	June 30   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  274.700     275.220     247.020   11.21 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.310     309.330     306.830    0.81 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.370     157.685     158.970   -1.01 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.690	46.760	47.182   -1.04 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  456.820     457.380     419.180    8.98 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.820     140.120     141.685   -1.32 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.161	16.158	16.185   -0.15 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  238.950     240.360     212.430   12.48 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.862	 1.867	 1.888   -1.38 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.557	 1.563	 1.581   -1.52 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  187.740     188.460     183.135    2.51 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
